---
description: >-
  Participants that declare both an inline `"alias"` field in the `@{...}`
  metadata and an external `as`/`AS` alias, verifying the external alias
  ("External Name" / "External DB") takes priority and is what actually
  renders.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant API@{ "type" : "boundary", "alias": "Internal Name" } as External Name
  participant DB@{ "type" : "database", "alias": "Internal DB" } AS External DB
  API ->> DB: Query
  DB -->> API: Result
